{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1000_p", "source_sha256": "1a1fe838da4a3c281458fb3fc5886f1ccdaf33533698f6663160ddebde6c6f0d", "ja": "（伊織のPV撮影が終わった。月をモチーフにした\n幻想的なステージ……うん、いいPVになりそうだ）", "zh": "（伊织的PV拍摄完成了。以月亮为主题的\n幻想舞台……嗯，感觉会是个好PV。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "e7bf034fc8560c9c00129046a4cb786c474111870e24403a66373ddb7ed2f2bc", "ja": "お疲れさま、{$P$}。\n今日の撮影、なかなか良かったんじゃないかしら。", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了。\n今天的拍摄还挺不错的嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1002_p", "source_sha256": "64c8f06c923fc7c5cdc80554c15b79deeec47f5b1367fad2f222b94a22dc4e79", "ja": "お疲れさま、伊織。いい映像が撮れたって\n監督も言ってたよ。完成が楽しみだな。", "zh": "伊织，辛苦了。导演也说拍到了\n很棒的画面喔，真让人期待成品。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1003_007ior", "source_sha256": "1fd97cbe76196fb9f635aa916e74372bb72316eecd0795a0ed895a7b63fea84a", "ja": "ま、このスーパーアイドル伊織ちゃんのPVだし、\nいい映像が撮れるのは当然よね～。にひひっ♪", "zh": "毕竟是我这个超级偶像伊织主演的PV，\n拍到好画面也是理所当然的～咿嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "843c5ec7c05c935871a3451f75acad9de9986d5e4662b70b8607ffb6e83642a9", "ja": "でも、ホントにできが良かったとしたら……\n今回は、アンタのおかげかもね。", "zh": "不过，要是真的有很棒的成品……\n这次的功劳可能要算你的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1005_p", "source_sha256": "65f16c4a8ffa0dcdc758c62b97a9c1842e6a6fdbf70e322f0c8ba8994a5a8950", "ja": "えっ、俺の？", "zh": "咦？算我的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "10eedc9f8117c3e89be163d6e8bd1acb0c8dbcbf89a117767b4522b41ee39a9a", "ja": "ええ。だって月にうさぎでしょ？\nかわいくて、私にピッタリだもの♪", "zh": "没错，月亮不就是要配兔子吗？\n这么可爱当然和我再匹配不过了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "d279c47dfa853b563f6bb971f45af9dec6645f07d36911e0da2eb11c43aba7ea", "ja": "衣装も……その、素敵だし……。\n伊織ちゃんに相応しい仕事だったと思うわ。", "zh": "服装……也很漂亮……\n这份工作真的很适合伊织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1008_p", "source_sha256": "6dfb8af215298d024e98d67238613b2bd2cd49de258fda677d6a2764606c9e42", "ja": "ははっ、そうか。\n伊織にそう言ってもらえると、うれしいよ。", "zh": "哈哈，是这样啊。\n真高兴能听到伊织这么说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "db9856ac45da3bd773e264da26298ac49cfe277ef84b60ffe1800d3629e50e6b", "ja": "仕掛けもいろいろ凝ってたわよね。\nプロジェクションマッピングを使ったりとか。", "zh": "器材方面也下了很多苦心呢。\n还用了光雕投影之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "982a5f4d0845a07bc7a107f91bba73951650fecbca79b20ef940a63d1843f7ac", "ja": "あんまり慣れてないから、\nホントはちょっと心配だったけど……", "zh": "因为我不是很习惯，\n本来还有点担心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "d8a5fdf8a9415589629927b404e1a0a78c15282f65a450a5643eb445826c18dc", "ja": "でも、最後にはぜ～んぶ成功させちゃうなんて！\nさすが私よね～♪", "zh": "不过，最后还是全～部搞定了！\n我果然厉害～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1012_p", "source_sha256": "9a6f946538cb9426a7211aad9cf26e25f1c17f749a2ab3fa1696d2a3de295ed1", "ja": "そうだな。\nそれでこそ765プロのアイドル、水瀬伊織だ！", "zh": "没错。\n这才是765艺能的偶像，水濑伊织！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "1f7fa3b2a48707936e61a06268a44d873b01830983c7ab8205ef5ecb290fe98d", "ja": "あら、素直に認めるのね……。\nまっ、いいわ。", "zh": "哎呀，你这么老实就认同了……\n也好，算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "99b5f1a1b3e7777877799ed3488ba7fb0ce28851b125667dde929efa55dfb9ab", "ja": "で？　もちろん次も、その次も、この伊織ちゃんに\n相応しい仕事を用意してるんでしょうね？", "zh": "然后呢？下次还有下下次的工作，\n你当然也都会准备好适合伊织的内容吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f25b87023ccc7fa22d30e3a24444033e09fba39eb48b2b5533b3eaababb0d5d7", "ja": "も、もちろん。プロデューサーとしては、\n常に新しいことを考えるべきだし……頑張るよ。", "zh": "这、这还用说，我身为制作人，\n也该时常思考新的企划……我会加油的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e51504ecc49aa0f0088b543e4ed8953f894601ed89edc39f6276de0030841fad", "ja": "それより、そろそろ戻ろうか。\n夜は冷えるし、風邪をひいたら困るから。", "zh": "不过这些以后再说吧，我们该回去了。\n晚上会变冷，你要是感冒我会很头痛的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "d3ad6bb32263f9671a4472031e6b2c844d5ee80cc41fe86e923ae3ef303ea638", "ja": "ええ、けど……ねえ、{$P$}。\nもうすこしだけ、月を見ていかない？", "zh": "嗯，不过……{$P$}，\n要不要再欣赏一下月亮？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1018_p", "source_sha256": "38ea686e61f3cad19ceb4321730072e1d5cc0d2781b88cf11f51baf3986c1f8f", "ja": "構わないけど……\n月見なら撮影中、もう十分したんじゃないのか？", "zh": "好是好……但你在拍摄时，\n不是已经赏了很久吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "ff13b24a041111ee17a8ca916ba990807bc43673672b642d2ef61e499c46e9ee", "ja": "もう、鈍いわね。撮影中は撮影中でしょ！", "zh": "讨厌，你很迟钝耶。拍摄是拍摄啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "13d040c4be4747ab73640cadf3fa3fceaec77741251d078a5a024364c3ac9f85", "ja": "それに、いくらキレイでも、\nひとりで見てたってつまらないもの。", "zh": "而且就算月亮再美，\n自己一个人看也没意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1021_007ior", "source_sha256": "5e2bbee989c988b8c65a1dcb82d73daf4f5c790281323c6ed4029d69922c3fa6", "ja": "だから、ふたりでお月見するのよ。\nもちろん、お団子も用意しなさいよね！　にひひっ♪", "zh": "所以，现在要两个人一起赏月。\n当然，你还要负责准备团子喔！咿嘻嘻♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1022_p", "source_sha256": "87e315f6493c00c46787af1f05ca669f98b1e945418302817d2b0145565799d3", "ja": "そうか……わかった。\nじゃあもう少し、月見をしていくか！", "zh": "这样啊……我知道了。\n那我们就再欣赏一下月亮吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1023_p", "source_sha256": "870b4dc31998189defb2cca61097b60434780d92748ed533bc614533dcc1b342", "ja": "（それから急いでお団子を買ってきて、\n伊織と一緒にお月見をした）", "zh": "（之后我急忙去买团子，\n跟伊织一起赏月。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0084_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0084_1024_p", "source_sha256": "2875460ae15d93dd4aa69a46b9ad78f59ea5a32c0d9b01ec767ac83fa1cd7cca", "ja": "（月を見上げる伊織の眼差しは、とても柔らかい……。\nきっと月のウサギとも、仲がいいんだろう）", "zh": "（伊织仰望明月的眼神非常温柔……\n我想她和月兔的感情肯定也很不错吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
